      "side": 1,
      "message": "It looks like this code might perform several BPF map operations. Instead of performing all those operations, is there a reason we can\u0027t simply do it with one read? Something like:\n\n    final byte[] rawValue \u003d getRawValue(key.writeToBytes());\n    return rawValue !\u003d null;",
